# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/backup

## Purpose
Owns Android application logic for exporting, importing, or restoring LumiNet backup state.

## Contents
Contains Kotlin/Java backup models and helpers that translate persisted application state to and from backup representations.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Called by Android application flows and depends on the app's persistence/configuration contracts and platform storage APIs where required.

## Invariants
Backup operations must not silently discard unknown or invalid state, must surface failures, and must avoid exposing secret material beyond the intended backup contract.